IRA THE WAYFINDER</div><p class="muted" id="questText">Find Mira near the old lantern and ask about the Wildroots.</p><div class="progress"><i id="questFill"></i></div><div class="muted" id="questCount">0 / 1 OBJECTIVE</div><button id="logBtn" style="margin-top:8px;background:none;border:0;color:#c3d2bc;font:9px monospace">VIEW ADVENTURE LOG →</button></section><section class="panel"><h3>✳ FIELD CRAFTING · WORKBENCH</h3><div class="recipe"><div><b>Wildwood Platform</b><small>Build a little higher · 🪵 <span id="woodCost">0 / 3</span></small></div><button id="craftPlatform">CRAFT</button></div><div class="recipe"><div><b>Spore tonic</b><small>Restore 35 vitality · ✿ <span id="sporeCost">0 / 2</span></small></div><button id="craftPotion">CRAFT</button></div><div class="recipe"><div><b>Rootbound blade</b><small>Unlock the Warrior path · ◆ <span id="oreCost">0 / 3</span>, 🪵 <span id="bladeWood">0 / 2</span></small></div><button id="craftBlade">CRAFT</button></div></section><section class="panel"><h3>✦ YOUR CALLING · JOB PATH</h3><div class="path"><button class="sel" data-path="adventurer">✧<br>Adventurer</button><button disabled id="warrior" data-path="warrior">⚔<br>Warrior</button><button disabled>☄<br>Arcanist</button></div><p class="muted" id="pathText">A little of everything, and all the room to grow.</p></section><section class="panel muted">✦ <b>THE WORLD IS YOURS</b><br>Break the earth, shape a path, and see what’s waiting above.</section></aside></main><footer class="foot"><span>MYTHROOT · WILDS OF AETHER</span><span>A/D MOVE · W JUMP · CLICK MINE · F ATTACK · Q SKILL · E INTERACT · H HEAL</span><span>ALPHA 0.1.7</span></footer></div><div class="modal" id="modal"><article><button class="close" id="close">×</button><h2 id="modalTitle"></h2><div id="modalText"></div></article></div>
